msgid ""
"`--quantization ascend` selects the Ascend model quantization "
"implementation; `--kv-cache-dtype mxfp8` selects MXFP8 KV cache storage. "
"They configure different parts of inference. Enable `mxfp8` only with a "
"supported checkpoint and its required KV scale metadata. A W4A8/W8A8 name, "
"or an MXFP weight format, does not by itself establish C8 KV cache "
"compatibility. Do not copy a W4A8C8 or W8A8C8 KV setting to a different "
"checkpoint without checking its quantization description and serving logs. "
"Keep the weight revision, tokenizer, quantization metadata, and KV cache "
"settings consistent on P and D."
msgstr ""
"`--quantization ascend` 选择昇腾模型量化实现；`--kv-cache-dtype mxfp8` 选择 MXFP8 KV "
"缓存存储。二者配置的是推理的不同部分。仅在 checkpoint 受支持且具备所需的 KV scale 元数据时，才启用 "
"`mxfp8`。W4A8/W8A8 名称或 MXFP 权重格式本身并不能确立 C8 KV 缓存兼容性。在未检查量化说明和服务日志之前，不要将 "
"W4A8C8 或 W8A8C8 的 KV 设置复制到其他 checkpoint。请确保 P 和 D 上的权重版本、tokenizer、量化元数据和 KV"
" 缓存设置保持一致。"

msgid ""
"It is recommended to download the model weights to a shared directory across"
" multiple nodes, such as `/root/.cache/`, so that all serving nodes can load"
" the same path."
msgstr "建议将模型权重下载到多节点共享的目录中，例如 `/root/.cache/`，以便所有服务节点都能加载同一路径。"

msgid ""
"> **Path description**: Download the model weights to a directory of your "
"choice and record it. Ensure the model path in the subsequent deployment "
"command matches this directory."
msgstr "> **路径说明**：将模型权重下载到您选择的目录并记录该目录。确保后续部署命令中的模型路径与该目录一致。"

msgid "### 3.2 Verify Multi-node Communication"
msgstr "### 3.2 验证多节点通信"

msgid ""
"For multi-node deployment, verify inter-node connectivity by following "
"[Verify Multi-node "
"Communication](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-multi-"
"node-interconnect)."
msgstr ""
"对于多节点部署，请按照[验证多节点通信](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-"
"multi-node-interconnect)中的说明验证节点间连通性。"

msgid ""
"Use mutually reachable service IPs on all nodes. In the scripts below, "
"`local_ip` must belong to `nic_name`."
msgstr "在所有节点上使用可相互访问的服务 IP。在以下脚本中，`local_ip` 必须属于 `nic_name`。"

msgid ""
"For 950DT PD deployment, prepare the [Mooncake communication "
"environment](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md) and mount"
" the required host-specific communication resources into each serving "
"container. When `ascend_local_comm_res_path=/etc/hixlep` is set, ensure that"
" `/etc/hixlep` contains the configuration required for that host."
msgstr ""
"对于 Ascend 950DT系列产品的 PD 部署，请准备 [Mooncake "
"通信环境](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)，并将所需的主机特定通信资源挂载到每个服务容器中。当设置"
" `ascend_local_comm_res_path=/etc/hixlep` 时，请确保 `/etc/hixlep` 包含该主机所需的配置。"

msgid ""
"Select an image for your hardware and start a container on each node. Refer "
"to [Using Docker](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-"
"prebuilt-image) for details."
msgstr ""
"为您的硬件选择合适的镜像，并在每个节点上启动容器。详情请参阅[使用 "
"Docker](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-prebuilt-image)。"

msgid ""
"For PD deployment, use the same vLLM-Ascend release image and dependency "
"versions on P and D."
msgstr "对于 PD 部署，请在 P 和 D 上使用相同的 vLLM-Ascend 发布镜像和依赖版本。"

msgid "Start a Docker container on each node."
msgstr "在每个节点上启动 Docker 容器。"

msgid ""
"Keep the container's `/usr/lib64` from the selected image. Mounting the "
"entire host directory over it can hide image-provided system libraries and "
"break the matched CANN/runtime dependencies; making that whole-directory "
"mount read-only does not prevent library shadowing. If the selected "
"URMA/RoCE transport requires additional host libraries, mount only the "
"specific compatible files or vendor directory required by its installation "
"guide, read-only, and verify the library loader paths inside the container."
msgstr ""
"请保留所选镜像中容器自带的 `/usr/lib64`。将整个主机目录挂载覆盖到该路径上可能会遮蔽镜像提供的系统库，并破坏已匹配的 "
"CANN/运行时依赖；即使将该整目录挂载设为只读，也无法防止库被遮蔽。如果所选的 URMA/RoCE "
"传输需要额外的主机库，请仅以只读方式挂载其安装指南所要求的特定兼容文件或厂商目录，并验证容器内的库加载路径。"

msgid ""
"After entering the actual serving container on each node, check the "
"executables, versions, and imported paths:"
msgstr "进入每个节点上实际的服务容器后，检查可执行文件、版本和导入路径："

msgid ""
"Single-node deployment runs both Prefill and Decode on the same node. It is "
"suitable for functional validation and long-context serving."
msgstr "单节点部署在同一节点上同时运行 Prefill 和 Decode。它适用于功能验证和长上下文服务。"

msgid ""
"Run the following script for online inference on one 950DT Products node (96"
" GB x 8). The quantized versions (`Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w8a8-mxfp8` and "
"`Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w4a4-mxfp4`) can be deployed on a single node and require"
" `--quantization ascend`."
msgstr ""
"在单个Ascend 950DT系列产品节点（96 GB x "
"8）上运行以下脚本进行在线推理。量化版本（`Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w8a8-mxfp8` 和 "
"`Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w4a4-mxfp4`）可部署在单个节点上，并且需要 `--quantization ascend`。"

msgid ""
"For W8A8 deployment, 2 Atlas 800I A2 (64 GB x 8) nodes are required. Refer "
"to [Section 5.2](#52-multi-node-deployment-with-mp-recommended) for multi-"
"node MP deployment."
msgstr ""
"W8A8部署需要2个Atlas 800I A2（64 GB x 8）节点。多节点MP部署请参考[第5.2节](#52-multi-node-"
"deployment-with-mp-recommended)。"

msgid ""
"- `--data-parallel-size 1` uses one DP group. `--tensor-parallel-size` is 16 for the A3 example and 8 for the 950DT example.\n"
"- `--enable-expert-parallel` enables expert parallelism for MoE layers. Do not mix MoE tensor parallelism and expert parallelism in the same MoE layer.\n"
"- `--max-model-len` is the maximum input plus output length for a single request. Increase it only when enough KV cache is available.\n"
"- `--max-num-seqs` is the maximum number of active requests scheduled by each DP group. For performance tests, set `--max-num-seqs * --data-parallel-size` greater than or equal to the test concurrency.\n"
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens` is the maximum number of tokens processed in one scheduler step. A larger value can improve prefill efficiency but consumes more activation memory.\n"
"- `--gpu-memory-utilization` controls how much HBM vLLM can use to calculate KV cache capacity. A higher value increases KV cache size but can trigger OOM if runtime memory is higher than the profile run.\n"
"- `--enable-prefix-caching` enables prefix caching. For Qwen3.5, short prefixes may not be cached when the hybrid KV cache manager adjusts the block size to a large value.\n"
"- `--quantization ascend` enables Ascend quantization for the quantized weights used above. Remove this option when deploying the BF16 model.\n"
"- `--speculative-config` enables Qwen3.5 MTP speculative decoding. Reduce `num_speculative_tokens` or remove this option if the workload is sensitive to first-token latency or if MTP is unstable in your environment.\n"
"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` enables full decode ACLGraph replay to reduce dispatch overhead.\n"
"- `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` selects Model Runner V1 for the single-node examples above.\n"
"- `--additional-config` configures Ascend-specific optimizations: `enable_cpu_binding=true` enables Ascend-native CPU binding; `enable_fused_mc2=1` selects dispatch-FFN-combine and is used by the single-node 950DT and A3 examples for compatibility with the documented MTP and batching configurations; `2` selects CANN MegaMoe and should only be enabled with a matching CANN/operator stack and supported token-shape limits; `0` disables the fused path. `enable_flashcomm1=true` enables MoE sequence parallelism across TP ranks and requires `--enable-expert-parallel` with a TP size greater than 1."
msgstr ""
"- `--data-parallel-size 1` 使用一个DP组。A3示例中 `--tensor-parallel-size` 为16，950DT示例中为8。\n"
"- `--enable-expert-parallel` 为MoE层启用专家并行。请勿在同一MoE层中混用MoE张量并行和专家并行。\n"
"- `--max-model-len` 是单个请求的最大输入加输出长度。仅在KV缓存充足时才增大该值。\n"
"- `--max-num-seqs` 是每个DP组调度的最大活跃请求数。进行性能测试时，请将 `--max-num-seqs * --data-parallel-size` 设置为大于或等于测试并发数。\n"
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens` 是单个调度步骤中处理的最大token数。较大的值可提高prefill效率，但会消耗更多激活内存。\n"
"- `--gpu-memory-utilization` 控制vLLM可用于计算KV缓存容量的HBM比例。较高的值会增大KV缓存大小，但如果运行时内存高于profile运行时的内存，可能会触发OOM。\n"
"- `--enable-prefix-caching` 启用前缀缓存。对于Qwen3.5，当混合KV缓存管理器将块大小调整为较大值时，短前缀可能不会被缓存。\n"
"- `--quantization ascend` 为上述量化权重启用昇腾量化。部署BF16模型时请移除此选项。\n"
"- `--speculative-config` 启用Qwen3.5 MTP投机解码。如果工作负载对首token延迟敏感，或MTP在您的环境中不稳定，请减小 `num_speculative_tokens` 或移除此选项。\n"
"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` 启用完整decode ACLGraph重放以减少调度开销。\n"
"- `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` 为上述单节点示例选择Model Runner V1。\n"
"- `--additional-config` 配置昇腾特定优化：`enable_cpu_binding=true` 启用昇腾原生CPU绑定；`enable_fused_mc2=1` 选择dispatch-FFN-combine，单节点950DT和A3示例使用该配置以兼容文档中描述的MTP和批处理配置；`2` 选择CANN MegaMoe，仅应在CANN/算子栈匹配且token形状限制受支持时启用；`0` 禁用融合路径。`enable_flashcomm1=true` 启用跨TP rank的MoE序列并行，需要 `--enable-expert-parallel` 且TP大小大于1。"

msgid ""
"Multi-node MP deployment uses vLLM data parallelism across nodes and tensor "
"parallelism within each node. It is recommended for the W8A8 model on 2 "
"Atlas 800I A2 (64 GB x 8) nodes."
msgstr ""
"多节点MP部署在节点间使用vLLM数据并行，在节点内使用张量并行。推荐用于2个Atlas 800I A2（64 GB x 8）节点上的W8A8模型。"

msgid ""
"Assume you have 2 Atlas 800I A2 nodes and want to deploy "
"`Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w8a8-mtp` across them. Replace `nic_name`, `local_ip`, "
"and `node0_ip` with the actual network interface and IP addresses in your "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"假设您有2个Atlas 800I A2节点，并希望跨节点部署 `Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w8a8-mtp`。请将 "
"`nic_name`、`local_ip` 和 `node0_ip` 替换为您环境中的实际网络接口和IP地址。"

msgid ""
"PD disaggregation separates Prefill and Decode into different service "
"groups. This performance-oriented example deploys 1P1D on one 16-NPU Atlas "
"800I A3 host with the `Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w4a8` checkpoint. In this section, "
"1P1D describes two service groups; it does not mean that P and D must occupy"
" separate hosts."
msgstr ""
"PD分离将Prefill和Decode分离到不同的服务组。这个面向性能的示例在单个16-NPU Atlas 800I A3主机上使用 "
"`Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w4a8` 检查点部署1P1D。在本节中，1P1D描述的是两个服务组；这并不意味着P和D必须占用独立的主机。"

msgid "The 16 NPUs are divided into two non-overlapping device sets:"
msgstr "16个NPU被划分为两个互不重叠的设备集："

msgid "| Service group | Physical devices | TP | DP | EP world size |"
msgstr "| 服务组 | 物理设备 | TP | DP | EP world size |"

msgid ""
"Prefill and Decode use the same service NIC and IP because they run on the "
"same host, but they use different HTTP and Mooncake ports. The Decode "
"launcher creates two local DP engines, each with TP4. Do not start a second "
"copy of the Decode command."
msgstr ""
"Prefill和Decode使用相同的服务网卡和IP，因为它们运行在同一主机上，但使用不同的HTTP和Mooncake端口。Decode启动器会创建两个本地DP引擎，每个引擎的TP为4。请勿启动Decode命令的第二个副本。"

msgid ""
"We recommend using Mooncake for deployment. Refer to "
"[Mooncake](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md) for the "
"general PD disaggregation workflow. This example uses `MooncakeConnectorV1` "
"with the standard Pull proxy in [Section 5.7](#57-request-forwarding)."
msgstr ""
"我们推荐使用Mooncake进行部署。通用PD分离工作流请参考[Mooncake](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)。本示例使用"
" `MooncakeConnectorV1` 以及[第5.7节](#57-request-forwarding)中的标准Pull代理。"

msgid "#### 5.4.1 Prefill Service Group"
msgstr "#### 5.4.1 Prefill服务组"

msgid ""
"Create `run_p.sh` on the A3 host. Set `nic_name`, `local_ip`, and "
"`MODEL_PATH` for the local environment."
msgstr "在A3主机上创建 `run_p.sh`。根据本地环境设置 `nic_name`、`local_ip` 和 `MODEL_PATH`。"

msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If the Prefill service does not become ready, confirm "
"that devices 0-7 are available, port 30060 and Mooncake port 55220 are "
"unused, and `local_ip` belongs to `nic_name`."
msgstr ""
"常见问题提示：如果Prefill服务未就绪，请确认设备0-7可用、端口30060和Mooncake端口55220未被占用，并且 `local_ip` "
"属于 `nic_name`。"

msgid "#### 5.4.2 Decode Service Group"
msgstr "#### 5.4.2 Decode服务组"

msgid ""
"Create `run_d.sh` on the same host. Use the same `nic_name`, `local_ip`, and"
" checkpoint revision as Prefill."
msgstr "在同一主机上创建 `run_d.sh`。使用与Prefill相同的 `nic_name`、`local_ip` 和检查点版本。"

msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If Decode fails to initialize, confirm that devices 8-15 "
"are available and that `--data-parallel-size 2`, `--data-parallel-size-local"
" 2`, `--tensor-parallel-size 4`, and the Mooncake topology describe the same"
" TP4/DP2 layout. Ports 30050, 6884, and 56010 must be available."
msgstr ""
"常见问题提示：如果Decode初始化失败，请确认设备8-15可用，并且 `--data-parallel-size 2`、`--data-"
"parallel-size-local 2`、`--tensor-parallel-size 4` "
"和Mooncake拓扑描述的是相同的TP4/DP2布局。端口30050、6884和56010必须可用。"

msgid "#### 5.4.3 Proxy"
msgstr "#### 5.4.3 代理"

msgid ""
"After both services report ready, start the standard Pull proxy on the same "
"A3 host. Because this is a single-host 1P1D topology, Prefill, Decode, and "
"the proxy use the same `local_ip` and are distinguished by their ports."
msgstr ""
"两个服务均报告就绪后，在同一A3主机上启动标准Pull代理。由于这是单主机1P1D拓扑，Prefill、Decode和代理使用相同的 "
"`local_ip`，并通过各自的端口进行区分。"

msgid ""
"Run the command from the directory containing "
"`load_balance_proxy_server_example.py`:"
msgstr "在包含 `load_balance_proxy_server_example.py` 的目录中运行该命令："

msgid "Send client requests to `http://<LOCAL_SERVICE_IP>:8000`."
msgstr "将客户端请求发送到 `http://<LOCAL_SERVICE_IP>:8000`。"

msgid ""
"- Prefill uses TP8/DP1 on devices 0-7. Decode uses TP4/DP2 on devices 8-15. With expert parallelism enabled, both service groups have an EP world size of 8.\n"
"- The P and D device lists must not overlap. P and D can share the same service IP on a single host, but their HTTP and Mooncake ports must be different.\n"
"- The Decode command starts both local DP ranks. Do not launch one Decode command per DP rank.\n"
"- `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` selects Model Runner V1 on both service groups.\n"
"- Use the same MTP method and `num_speculative_tokens` on P and D. To disable MTP for a comparison, remove `--speculative-config` from both commands.\n"
"- `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill` must remain DP1/TP8, and `decode` must remain DP2/TP4 for this topology.\n"
"- `enable_flashcomm1=true`, `enable_fused_mc2=2`, and `enable_shared_expert_dp=true` reproduce the performance-case MoE configuration. They require the matching CANN operators and software stack.\n"
"- Prefill runs eagerly. Decode uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`, enables NPU graph extensions, and enables the recompute scheduler.\n"
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens 300` and `--max-num-seqs 100` are Decode scheduler limits applied to each DP engine by vLLM.\n"
"- Prefix caching and asynchronous scheduling are enabled on both service groups in this validated case. Revalidate output correctness if either setting or the connector version changes."
msgstr ""
"- Prefill 在设备 0-7 上使用 TP8/DP1。Decode 在设备 8-15 上使用 TP4/DP2。启用专家并行后，两个服务组的 EP world size 均为 8。\n"
"- P 和 D 的设备列表不得重叠。P 和 D 可以在单台主机上共享同一服务 IP，但它们的 HTTP 端口和 Mooncake 端口必须不同。\n"
"- Decode 命令会启动两个本地 DP rank。不要为每个 DP rank 分别启动一个 Decode 命令。\n"
"- `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` 会在两个服务组上选择 Model Runner V1。\n"
"- 在 P 和 D 上使用相同的 MTP 方法和 `num_speculative_tokens`。如需关闭 MTP 进行对比，请从两个命令中移除 `--speculative-config`。\n"
"- 对于此拓扑，`kv_connector_extra_config.prefill` 必须保持为 DP1/TP8，`decode` 必须保持为 DP2/TP4。\n"
"- `enable_flashcomm1=true`、`enable_fused_mc2=2` 和 `enable_shared_expert_dp=true` 可复现性能用例的 MoE 配置。它们需要匹配的 CANN 算子和软件栈。\n"
"- Prefill 以 eager 模式运行。Decode 使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`，启用 NPU 图扩展，并启用重计算调度器。\n"
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens 300` 和 `--max-num-seqs 100` 是 vLLM 应用于每个 DP 引擎的 Decode 调度器限制。\n"
"- 在此已验证用例中，两个服务组均启用了前缀缓存和异步调度。如果任一设置或连接器版本发生变化，请重新验证输出正确性。"

msgid ""
"This performance-oriented example deploys 1P1D on two 8-NPU 950DT hosts with"
" the [Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w4a8c8-mxfp](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-"
"Tech/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w4a8c8-mxfp) checkpoint. Set `MODEL_PATH` on both "
"nodes to the local directory containing this checkpoint:"
msgstr ""
"本性能导向示例在两台 8-NPU 的 950DT 主机上部署 1P1D，并使用 "
"[Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w4a8c8-mxfp](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-"
"Tech/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w4a8c8-mxfp) 权重。将两个节点上的 `MODEL_PATH` 设置为包含该权重的本地目录："

msgid "| Node role | NPUs | TP | DP | EP world size |"
msgstr "| 节点角色 | NPU 数量 | TP | DP | EP world size |"

msgid ""
"Both nodes must use the same checkpoint revision, tokenizer, quantization "
"metadata, and `--kv-cache-dtype mxfp8`. This example uses "
"`MooncakeConnectorV2`: the proxy calls Prefill first, and Decode pulls the "
"KV cache. The connector topology must remain DP1/TP8 for Prefill and DP2/TP4"
" for Decode."
msgstr ""
"两个节点必须使用相同的权重版本、tokenizer、量化元数据和 `--kv-cache-dtype mxfp8`。本示例使用 "
"`MooncakeConnectorV2`：代理先调用 Prefill，Decode 再拉取 KV 缓存。连接器拓扑必须保持 Prefill 为 "
"DP1/TP8、Decode 为 DP2/TP4。"

msgid ""
"Use a high-speed service network that is reachable in both directions. On "
"each host, `local_ip` must be the IP assigned to `nic_name`. Prepare and "
"mount that host's own HIXL communication resources at `/etc/hixlep` as "
"described in [Section 3.2](#32-verify-multi-node-communication). Do not "
"reuse another host's endpoint resources."
msgstr ""
"使用可双向互通的高速服务网络。在每台主机上，`local_ip` 必须是分配给 `nic_name` 的 IP。按照[第 3.2 "
"节](#32-verify-multi-node-communication)所述，在 `/etc/hixlep` 准备并挂载该主机自身的 HIXL "
"通信资源。不要复用其他主机的端点资源。"

msgid ""
"Create `run_p.sh` on the Prefill host. Replace the NIC, IP, and model-path "
"placeholders. The HTTP port is 30060 and the Mooncake port is 55220."
msgstr ""
"在 Prefill 主机上创建 `run_p.sh`。替换 NIC、IP 和模型路径占位符。HTTP 端口为 30060，Mooncake 端口为 "
"55220。"

msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If Prefill does not become ready, verify the checkpoint "
"metadata, all eight visible NPUs, the selected high-speed IP/NIC pair, port "
"30060, Mooncake port 55220, and the host-specific `/etc/hixlep` resources."
msgstr ""
"常见问题提示：如果 Prefill 未就绪，请检查权重元数据、全部八个可见 NPU、所选的高速 IP/NIC 组合、端口 30060、Mooncake "
"端口 55220，以及该主机专属的 `/etc/hixlep` 资源。"

msgid ""
"Create `run_d.sh` on the Decode host. A single launcher starts two local DP "
"engines, each using TP4. Do not start two copies of this command. Replace "
"the NIC, IP, and model-path placeholders. The HTTP port is 30050, the DP RPC"
" port is 6884, and the Mooncake port is 56010."
msgstr ""
"在 Decode 主机上创建 `run_d.sh`。单个启动器会启动两个本地 DP 引擎，每个引擎使用 TP4。不要启动该命令的两个副本。替换 "
"NIC、IP 和模型路径占位符。HTTP 端口为 30050，DP RPC 端口为 6884，Mooncake 端口为 56010。"

msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If Decode fails to initialize, confirm that `--data-"
"parallel-size 2`, `--data-parallel-size-local 2`, `--tensor-parallel-size "
"4`, and the Mooncake topology describe the same DP2/TP4 layout. Verify ports"
" 30050, 6884, and 56010, and confirm that both local DP engines start."
msgstr ""
"常见问题提示：如果 Decode 初始化失败，请确认 `--data-parallel-size 2`、`--data-parallel-size-"
"local 2`、`--tensor-parallel-size 4` 和 Mooncake 拓扑描述的是相同的 DP2/TP4 布局。检查端口 "
"30050、6884 和 56010，并确认两个本地 DP 引擎均已启动。"

msgid "#### 5.5.3 Proxy"
msgstr "#### 5.5.3 代理"

msgid ""
"After both services report ready, start the standard Pull proxy on the "
"Prefill host. Use the same reachable service IPs assigned to `local_ip` in "
"the P and D commands. The Decode backend is the HTTP port `30050`, not the "
"DP RPC port `6884`."
msgstr ""
"两个服务均报告就绪后，在 Prefill 主机上启动标准 Pull 代理。使用与 P 和 D 命令中 `local_ip` 所分配的相同可访问服务 "
"IP。Decode 后端是 HTTP 端口 `30050`，而不是 DP RPC 端口 `6884`。"

