"`examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/`）："

msgid ""
"Send client requests to `http://<P_HIGH_SPEED_SERVICE_IP>:8000`. Before "
"testing generation, check the P endpoint, D endpoint, and proxy health as "
"described in [Section 6](#6-functional-verification)."
msgstr ""
