msgid "#### 5.5.4 C8 Accuracy and Compatibility Requirements"
msgstr "#### 5.5.4 C8 精度与兼容性要求"

msgid ""
"C8 KV cache is part of this performance recipe, not just a model-name "
"convention. Keep the following conditions together:"
msgstr "C8 KV 缓存是本性能方案的一部分，而不仅仅是模型名称的约定。请同时满足以下条件："

msgid ""
"- Use the same compatible W4A8C8 checkpoint revision, tokenizer, chat template, quantization metadata, and `--kv-cache-dtype mxfp8` on P and D.\n"
"- Use `MooncakeConnectorV2` and the standard Pull proxy in [Section 5.7](#57-request-forwarding).\n"
"- Use a v0.30.0 MRv1 build containing [the MXFP8 KV-scale fix #19017](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/19017), merged into `releases/v0.30.0` as `14c6c3f43`, or a build with an equivalent verified fix.\n"
"- Keep `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0`, the P DP1/TP8 and D DP2/TP4 topology, and the connector topology consistent.\n"
"- Keep MTP settings identical on P and D. To run an MTP-off comparison, remove `--speculative-config` from both commands.\n"
"- Prefix caching and asynchronous scheduling are enabled on both nodes for this performance case.\n"
"- Prefill uses eager execution. Decode uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` and enables NPU graph extensions.\n"
"- `enable_fused_mc2=0` and `enable_prefill_mc2=false` reproduce this performance case. Do not infer the active setting from a profiling directory name.\n"
"- `enable_shared_expert_dp=true` and `enable_flashcomm1=true` require expert parallelism and the matching CANN/software stack.\n"
"- The D HTTP endpoint fronts both local DP engines. Do not use the DP RPC port as a Decode endpoint."
msgstr ""
"- 在 P 和 D 上使用相同的兼容 W4A8C8 权重版本、tokenizer、聊天模板、量化元数据和 `--kv-cache-dtype mxfp8`。\n"
"- 使用 `MooncakeConnectorV2` 和[第 5.7 节](#57-request-forwarding)中的标准 Pull 代理。\n"
"- 使用包含 [MXFP8 KV-scale 修复 #19017](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/19017) 的 v0.30.0 MRv1 构建（该修复已以 `14c6c3f43` 合入 `releases/v0.30.0`），或使用具有等效已验证修复的构建。\n"
"- 保持 `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0`、P 的 DP1/TP8 和 D 的 DP2/TP4 拓扑以及连接器拓扑一致。\n"
"- 保持 P 和 D 上的 MTP 设置完全相同。如需运行关闭 MTP 的对比，请从两个命令中移除 `--speculative-config`。\n"
"- 本性能用例在两个节点上均启用了前缀缓存和异步调度。\n"
"- Prefill 使用 eager 执行。Decode 使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 并启用 NPU 图扩展。\n"
"- `enable_fused_mc2=0` 和 `enable_prefill_mc2=false` 可复现本性能用例。不要根据 profiling 目录名称推断当前生效的设置。\n"
"- `enable_shared_expert_dp=true` 和 `enable_flashcomm1=true` 需要专家并行以及匹配的 CANN/软件栈。\n"
"- D 的 HTTP 端点位于两个本地 DP 引擎之前。不要将 DP RPC 端口用作 Decode 端点。"

msgid ""
"Use the standard Pull proxy with Prefill port 30060 and Decode port 30050. "
"Start with short non-streaming requests, then verify request churn and the "
"full accuracy baseline before performance testing. HTTP success or Mooncake "
"transfer completion alone does not prove that C8 scale contents are correct."
" Check predictions for empty output, repeated punctuation, incoherent text, "
"and abnormal repetition; evaluate MTP acceptance together with actual output"
" correctness."
msgstr ""
"使用标准 Pull 代理，Prefill 端口为 30060，Decode 端口为 "
"30050。先发送短的非流式请求，然后验证请求轮转和完整精度基线，再进行性能测试。仅 HTTP 成功或 Mooncake 传输完成并不能证明 C8 "
"规模的内容正确。检查预测结果是否存在空输出、重复标点、文本不连贯和异常重复；结合实际输出正确性评估 MTP 接受率。"

msgid ""
"PD disaggregation separates Prefill and Decode into different service "
"groups. Prefill nodes process large prompt chunks, Decode nodes serve token "
"generation, and a proxy forwards requests between them. These examples "
"demonstrate how to tune prefill and decode resource ratios."
msgstr ""
"PD 分离将 Prefill 和 Decode 拆分为不同的服务组。Prefill 节点处理较大的 prompt 块，Decode 节点负责 token"
" 生成，代理在两者之间转发请求。这些示例演示如何调优 prefill 和 decode 的资源配比。"

msgid ""
"For Atlas 800I A2 (64 GB x 8), we recommend deploying 1P1D with 2 nodes for "
"`Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w4a8-mtp`:"
msgstr ""
"对于 Atlas 800I A2（64 GB x 8），针对 `Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w4a8-mtp`，我们推荐使用 2 个节点部署 "
"1P1D："

msgid ""
"- 1 Prefill node: 1 Atlas 800I A2 (64 GB x 8).\n"
"- 1 Decode node: 1 Atlas 800I A2 (64 GB x 8)."
msgstr ""
"- 1 个 Prefill 节点：1 台 Atlas 800I A2（64 GB x 8）。\n"
"- 1 个 Decode 节点：1 台 Atlas 800I A2（64 GB x 8）。"

msgid ""
"- `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` selects Model Runner V1 on both nodes.\n"
"- `--distributed-executor-backend mp` uses multiprocessing on each node for the local workers.\n"
"- Prefill uses `--data-parallel-size 1` and `--tensor-parallel-size 8`. This creates 1 DP group with TP8.\n"
"- Decode uses `--data-parallel-size 1` and `--tensor-parallel-size 8`. This creates 1 DP group with TP8.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-address` and `--data-parallel-rpc-port` define the DP control plane.\n"
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens` is larger on the prefill node and smaller on the decode node because prefill is prompt-token intensive while decode is latency sensitive.\n"
"- `scheduler_config.recompute_scheduler_enable` sends requests back to the prefill side to recompute KV cache when decode KV cache is insufficient. Enable it only on the decode node in PD mode.\n"
"- `--kv-transfer-config` sets the Mooncake connector. `kv_role` is `kv_producer` on prefill and `kv_consumer` on decode.\n"
"- `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` and `decode.dp_size/tp_size` must match the actual global DP and TP layout.\n"
"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": \"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` is recommended on the decode node to reduce decode dispatch overhead."
msgstr ""
"- `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` 在两个节点上选择 Model Runner V1。\n"
"- `--distributed-executor-backend mp` 在每个节点上为本地 worker 使用多进程。\n"
"- Prefill 使用 `--data-parallel-size 1` 和 `--tensor-parallel-size 8`。这会创建 1 个 DP 组，TP 为 8。\n"
"- Decode 使用 `--data-parallel-size 1` 和 `--tensor-parallel-size 8`。这会创建 1 个 DP 组，TP 为 8。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-address` 和 `--data-parallel-rpc-port` 定义 DP 控制平面。\n"
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens` 在 prefill 节点上较大，在 decode 节点上较小，因为 prefill 是 prompt token 密集型，而 decode 对延迟敏感。\n"
"- `scheduler_config.recompute_scheduler_enable` 在 decode KV cache 不足时将请求发回 prefill 侧重新计算 KV cache。在 PD 模式下仅在 decode 节点上启用。\n"
"- `--kv-transfer-config` 设置 Mooncake 连接器。`kv_role` 在 prefill 上为 `kv_producer`，在 decode 上为 `kv_consumer`。\n"
"- `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` 和 `decode.dp_size/tp_size` 必须与实际全局 DP 和 TP 布局匹配。\n"
"- 建议在 decode 节点上使用 `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": \"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` 以减少 decode 调度开销。"

msgid "#### 5.6.3 Proxy"
msgstr "#### 5.6.3 代理"

msgid ""
"After both services report ready, start the standard Pull proxy on the "
"Prefill host. Use the same service IPs configured as `local_ip` in the two "
"scripts and the HTTP ports passed as argument 2."
msgstr ""
"两个服务均报告就绪后，在 Prefill 主机上启动标准 Pull 代理。使用两个脚本中配置为 `local_ip` 的相同服务 IP，以及作为参数 2"
" 传递的 HTTP 端口。"

msgid ""
"Send client requests to `http://<PREFILL_NODE_IP>:8000`. Use the Decode HTTP"
" port `30050`, not the DP RPC port `6884`."
msgstr ""
"将客户端请求发送到 `http://<PREFILL_NODE_IP>:8000`。使用 Decode HTTP 端口 `30050`，而不是 DP "
"RPC 端口 `6884`。"

msgid ""
"Use the proxy paired with the actual connector, rather than choosing it by "
"hardware name. The standard proxy script is in "
"`examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/`; run the command from that directory. "
"Replace the example hosts with reachable service IPs and use each service's "
"HTTP port. P, D, and the client must use the same `--served-model-name`."
msgstr ""
"使用与实际连接器配对的代理，而不是根据硬件名称选择代理。标准代理脚本位于 "
"`examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/`；请从该目录运行命令。将示例主机替换为可达的服务 IP，并使用各服务的 HTTP"
" 端口。P、D 和客户端必须使用相同的 `--served-model-name`。"

msgid "| Connector | Request Order | Proxy | Scope |"
msgstr "| 连接器 | 请求顺序 | 代理 | 适用范围 |"

msgid ""
"Equal TP sizes do not make these connectors interchangeable. For unequal TP,"
" verify the direction, divisibility, replicated KV heads, hybrid state "
"layout, and quantization support of the selected implementation. The TP8-to-"
"TP4 example does not imply arbitrary TP ratios or reverse-direction support."
" Use scripts from the same vLLM-Ascend revision as the serving stack."
msgstr ""
"TP 大小相等并不意味着这些连接器可以互换。对于非等 TP，请验证所选实现的方向、整除性、复制的 KV head、混合状态布局和量化支持。TP8 到 "
"TP4 的示例并不意味着支持任意 TP 比例或反向支持。使用与服务栈相同 vLLM-Ascend 修订版本的脚本。"

msgid "Use the complete proxy command for the selected deployment:"
msgstr "使用所选部署对应的完整代理命令："

msgid ""
"- [A3 single-host 1P1D](#543-proxy): P and D use the same service IP and different HTTP ports.\n"
"- [950DT two-host 1P1D](#553-proxy): P and D use their respective high-speed service IPs; the D backend is HTTP port `30050`.\n"
"- [A2 two-host 1P1D](#563-proxy): P and D use their respective service IPs and the HTTP ports passed to the launcher scripts."
msgstr ""
"- [A3 单机 1P1D](#543-proxy)：P 和 D 使用相同的服务 IP 和不同的 HTTP 端口。\n"
"- [950DT 双机 1P1D](#553-proxy)：P 和 D 使用各自的高速服务 IP；D 后端为 HTTP 端口 `30050`。\n"
"- [A2 双机 1P1D](#563-proxy)：P 和 D 使用各自的服务 IP 以及传递给启动脚本的 HTTP 端口。"

msgid ""
"Wait for both P and D to report ready, verify each HTTP service, then start "
"the matching proxy. For single-node and MP deployment, use the API endpoint "
"on node 0. For PD disaggregation, send generation requests through the proxy"
" so that the test covers KV transfer."
msgstr ""
"等待 P 和 D 均报告就绪，验证各 HTTP 服务，然后启动匹配的代理。对于单节点和 MP 部署，使用节点 0 上的 API 端点。对于 PD "
"分离，通过代理发送生成请求，以便测试覆盖 KV 传输。"

msgid ""
"Check that the advertised model name matches the request. A health check "
"only establishes HTTP readiness; it does not verify the PD data path. Send "
"several short requests, followed by concurrent requests that complete and "
"reuse cache slots, and inspect P, D, and proxy logs."
msgstr ""
"检查对外公布的模型名称与请求是否匹配。健康检查仅确认 HTTP 就绪，并不验证 PD "
"数据路径。先发送若干短请求，然后发送能够完成并复用缓存槽的并发请求，并检查 P、D 和代理日志。"

msgid ""
"Expected result: the HTTP status is 200 and the JSON response contains "
"nonempty, coherent generated text in `choices`. Also verify a chat request "
"with the checkpoint's chat template; a short completion request alone is not"
" an accuracy test. Check for transfer errors, empty results, repeated "
"punctuation, and abnormal repetition before running a full benchmark. Start "
"with non-streaming requests, then repeat with streaming to test the proxy's "
"chunked-response path."
msgstr ""
"预期结果：HTTP 状态码为 200，且 JSON 响应中的 `choices` 包含非空、连贯的生成文本。同时使用该 checkpoint 的 "
"chat template 验证一次 chat 请求；仅发送一个简短的 completion "
"请求并不足以作为精度测试。在运行完整基准测试之前，请检查是否存在传输错误、空结果、重复标点以及异常重复。先使用非流式请求，然后使用流式请求重复测试，以验证代理的分块响应路径。"

msgid "### 6.1 Function Calling"
msgstr "### 6.1 函数调用"

msgid ""
"To enable tool calling, append the following options to the `vllm serve` "
"command. For PD deployment, add them to both the Prefill and Decode commands"
" and restart both services."
msgstr ""
"要启用工具调用，请在 `vllm serve` 命令中追加以下选项。对于 PD 部署，请将其同时添加到 Prefill 和 Decode "
"命令中，并重启两个服务。"

msgid ""
"`--enable-auto-tool-choice` allows the model to select a tool, `--tool-call-"
"parser qwen3_coder` parses tool calls, and `--reasoning-parser qwen3` "
"separates reasoning from the final answer."
msgstr ""
"`--enable-auto-tool-choice` 允许模型选择工具，`--tool-call-parser qwen3_coder` "
"解析工具调用，`--reasoning-parser qwen3` 将推理过程与最终答案分离。"

msgid ""
"Send a chat request with a tool definition to the service endpoint. For PD "
"deployment, use the proxy endpoint."
msgstr "向服务端点发送一个包含工具定义的 chat 请求。对于 PD 部署，请使用代理端点。"

msgid ""
"When the model selects the tool, check that `choices[0].message.tool_calls` "
"contains the function name `get_weather` and a JSON argument string with "
"`city` set to `Beijing`. The client must execute the function, then send the"
" assistant tool-call message and a `role: \"tool\"` result message with the "
"matching `tool_call_id` in the next request to obtain the final answer. The "
"serving process parses tool calls; it does not execute the function."
msgstr ""
"当模型选择该工具时，请检查 `choices[0].message.tool_calls` 是否包含函数名 `get_weather` 以及一个将 "
"`city` 设置为 `Beijing` 的 JSON 参数字符串。客户端必须执行该函数，然后在下一个请求中发送 assistant "
"的工具调用消息以及一条带有匹配 `tool_call_id` 的 `role: \"tool\"` "
"结果消息，以获取最终答案。服务进程只解析工具调用，并不执行该函数。"

msgid ""
