msgid ""
"Check that the weight precision and device allocation match [Section "
"3.1](#31-model-weight), and use `--quantization ascend` for the quantized "
"examples. Reduce context length, concurrency, or batched tokens as needed, "
"and leave runtime memory headroom when setting `--gpu-memory-utilization`. "
"Follow the tuning order in [Section 9.2](#92-tuning-guidelines)."
msgstr ""
"请检查权重精度和设备分配是否与[第 3.1 节](#31-model-weight)一致，并在量化示例中使用 `--quantization "
"ascend`。根据需要减少上下文长度、并发数或批处理 token 数，并在设置 `--gpu-memory-utilization` "
"时预留运行时内存余量。请遵循[第 9.2 节](#92-tuning-guidelines)中的调优顺序。"

msgid ""
"Verify connectivity using [Section 3.2](#32-verify-multi-node-"
"communication). Set `HCCL_IF_IP` to the selected NIC's IP and "
"`HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`/`GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME` to its interface name. Check the "
"DP master address, matching RPC ports, non-overlapping rank ranges, and the "
"worker node's `--headless` option against [Section 5.2](#52-multi-node-"
"deployment-with-mp-recommended)."
msgstr ""
"请使用[第 3.2 节](#32-verify-multi-node-communication)验证连通性。将 `HCCL_IF_IP` "
"设置为所选网卡的 IP，将 `HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`/`GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME` 设置为其接口名。请对照[第 5.2 "
"节](#52-multi-node-deployment-with-mp-recommended)检查 DP master 地址、匹配的 RPC "
"端口、不重叠的 rank 范围以及 worker 节点的 `--headless` 选项。"

msgid "### Q3: Can I enable prefix caching in PD disaggregation?"
msgstr "### Q3：我可以在 PD 分离中启用前缀缓存吗？"

msgid ""
"The [A3 PD](#54-prefill-decode-disaggregation-a3), [950DT W4A8C8 "
"PD](#55-prefill-decode-disaggregation-950dt-products), and [A2 "
"PD](#56-prefill-decode-disaggregation-a2) examples enable prefix caching. "
"When changing this setting, compare cached and uncached outputs, request "
"completion, and cache reuse with the same connector and software version."
msgstr ""
"[A3 PD](#54-prefill-decode-disaggregation-a3)、[950DT W4A8C8 PD](#55-prefill-"
"decode-disaggregation-950dt-products) 和 [A2 PD](#56-prefill-decode-"
"disaggregation-a2) 示例均启用了前缀缓存。更改此设置时，请在相同的 connector "
"和软件版本下比较启用缓存与未启用缓存的输出、请求完成情况和缓存复用情况。"

msgid ""
"Use the hardware-specific settings in [Section 9.3](#93-model-specific-"
"optimizations). Under the same workload, compare FlashComm and MC2 "
"separately against their disabled settings (`enable_flashcomm1=false` and "
"`enable_fused_mc2=0`). Preserve other required `--additional-config` fields "
"and check output correctness before comparing performance. The A2 examples "
"do not enable MC2."
msgstr ""
"请使用[第 9.3 节](#93-model-specific-optimizations)中针对特定硬件的设置。在相同负载下，分别将 "
"FlashComm 和 MC2 与其禁用设置（`enable_flashcomm1=false` 和 "
"`enable_fused_mc2=0`）进行比较。保留其他必需的 `--additional-config` "
"字段，并在比较性能之前检查输出正确性。A2 示例未启用 MC2。"

msgid ""
"Start with `num_speculative_tokens=3`, then compare TTFT, TPOT, and "
"throughput when adjusting it. For PD deployment, keep `method` and "
"`num_speculative_tokens` identical on Prefill and Decode; for an MTP-off "
"comparison, remove `--speculative-config` from both sides. Change one "
"setting at a time and check generated answers alongside acceptance "
"statistics; acceptance rate alone does not establish accuracy."
msgstr ""
"从 `num_speculative_tokens=3` 开始，调整时比较 TTFT、TPOT 和吞吐量。对于 PD 部署，请保持 Prefill 和 "
"Decode 上的 `method` 与 `num_speculative_tokens` 一致；如需进行关闭 MTP 的对比，请从两侧都移除 "
"`--speculative-config`。每次只更改一项设置，并在查看接受统计信息的同时检查生成的答案；仅凭接受率无法确定准确性。"

msgid ""
"### Q6: Why do C8 PD outputs contain repeated exclamation marks or lose "
"accuracy?"
msgstr "### Q6：为什么 C8 PD 输出包含重复的感叹号或丢失准确性？"

msgid ""
"Check that both nodes use the same C8 checkpoint revision and `--kv-cache-"
"dtype mxfp8`, with the topology and connector settings in [Section "
"5.5](#55-prefill-decode-disaggregation-950dt-products) and the requirements "
"in [Section 5.5.4](#554-c8-accuracy-and-compatibility-requirements). Inspect"
" checkpoint-loading and KV-transfer logs. After correcting the environment "
"or configuration, restart both services and verify short requests before "
"running the full accuracy evaluation. Earlier prerelease K/V-scale issues "
"were fixed by [#19017](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/19017), included in v0.30.0."
msgstr ""
"请检查两个节点是否使用相同的 C8 checkpoint 版本和 `--kv-cache-dtype mxfp8`，并符合[第 5.5 "
"节](#55-prefill-decode-disaggregation-950dt-products)中的拓扑和 connector 设置以及[第 "
"5.5.4 节](#554-c8-accuracy-and-compatibility-requirements)中的要求。检查 checkpoint "
"加载和 KV 传输日志。在修正环境或配置后，重启两个服务，并在运行完整准确性评估之前先验证短请求。早期预发布版本的 K/V scale 问题已由 "
"[#19017](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/19017) 修复，该修复包含在 "
"v0.30.0 中。"

msgid ""
"### Q7: Why is the benchmark score low despite apparently normal model "
"answers?"
msgstr "### Q7：为什么模型回答看起来正常，但基准测试分数却很低？"

msgid ""
"Inspect predictions for empty responses, truncated outputs, and answer-"
"extraction failures. Correlate failed requests with P/D and proxy logs, "
"including transfer timeouts and streaming errors. Report the full-dataset "
"score and failure counts, and verify the dataset, chat template, sampling "
"parameters, and output budget against [Section 7.1](#71-using-aisbench)."
msgstr ""
"请检查预测结果中是否存在空响应、输出截断和答案提取失败。将失败的请求与 P/D "
"和代理日志相关联，包括传输超时和流式错误。报告全数据集分数和失败计数，并对照[第 7.1 节](#71-using-"
"aisbench)验证数据集、chat template、采样参数和输出预算。"

msgid ""
"### Q8: Why do HIXL/Mooncake connections time out after the HTTP service "
"starts?"
msgstr "### Q8：为什么 HTTP 服务启动后 HIXL/Mooncake 连接会超时？"

msgid ""
"HTTP readiness does not verify KV transfer. Check P/D service IPs, NICs, "
"routes, physical NPU IDs, communication resource mounts, and KV ports using "
"[Section 3.2](#32-verify-multi-node-communication) and the [Mooncake "
"deployment guide](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md). "
"Ensure both nodes use matching runtime environments. After correcting the "
"configuration, restart both services and send a request through the proxy as"
" described in [Section 6](#6-functional-verification)."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 就绪并不代表 KV 传输已验证。请使用[第 3.2 节](#32-verify-multi-node-communication)和 "
"[Mooncake 部署指南](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)检查 P/D "
"服务 IP、网卡、路由、物理 NPU ID、通信资源挂载和 KV 端口。确保两个节点使用匹配的运行时环境。在修正配置后，重启两个服务，并按[第 6 "
"节](#6-functional-verification)所述通过代理发送请求。"

msgid ""
"Deploy `run_p.sh` and `run_d.sh` on the corresponding nodes, and deploy a "
"proxy script on the prefill master node to forward requests. For details "
"about how to deploy the agent script, see [Section 5.7](#57-request-"
"forwarding)."
msgstr ""
"在对应节点上部署 `run_p.sh` 和 `run_d.sh`，并在 prefill "
"主节点上部署代理脚本以转发请求。有关如何部署代理脚本的详细信息，请参见[第 5.7 节](#57-request-forwarding)。"

msgid ""
"Run the following script for online inference with a 133k context on one "
"Atlas 800I A3 node (64 GB x 16). W8A8 deployment requires `--quantization "
"ascend`."
msgstr ""
"在单台 Atlas 800I A3 节点（64 GB x 16）上运行以下脚本，进行 133k 上下文的在线推理。W8A8 部署需要 "
"`--quantization ascend`。"

msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If the service fails to start, HBM is insufficient, or "
"requests are not scheduled as expected, refer to [Public "
"FAQs](../../faqs.md) first, and then check the model-specific FAQ in "
"[Section 10](#10-faq)."
msgstr ""
"常见问题提示：如果服务启动失败、HBM 不足或请求未按预期调度，请先参考[公共 FAQ](../../faqs.md)，然后查看[第 10 "
"节](#10-faq)中针对具体模型的 FAQ。"

msgid "Run the Prefill script:"
msgstr "运行 Prefill 脚本："

msgid ""
"If the Prefill service starts successfully, information similar to the "
"following example is displayed:"
msgstr "如果 Prefill 服务启动成功，将显示类似以下示例的信息："

msgid "Run the Decode script in a separate terminal:"
msgstr "在另一个终端中运行 Decode 脚本："

msgid ""
"If the Decode service starts successfully, information similar to the "
"following example is displayed:"
msgstr "如果 Decode 服务启动成功，将显示类似以下示例的信息："

msgid "Run the Prefill script on the Prefill node:"
msgstr "在 Prefill 节点上运行 Prefill 脚本："

msgid "Run the Decode script on the Decode node:"
msgstr "在 Decode 节点上运行 Decode 脚本："

msgid ""
"Run the two scripts on their respective hosts after filling in each host's "
"NIC and IP. The examples use seven argument positions: visible devices, HTTP"
" port, global DP size, DP rank, DP master address, DP RPC port, and TP size."
" P reads only positions 1–3 and 7; positions 4–6 are unused and retained for"
" invocation compatibility. D uses all seven positions; its argument 5 is the"
" D host's service IP. Use DP1/TP8 to match the fixed KV topology; changing "
"topology also requires updating the connector JSON and device allocation. "
"Set the A2 proxy's `--prefiller-ports` and `--decoder-ports` in [Section "
"5.6.3](#563-proxy) to the HTTP ports passed as argument 2 to the respective "
"scripts."
msgstr ""
"填写各主机的网卡和 IP 后，在各自的主机上运行这两个脚本。示例使用七个参数位置：可见设备、HTTP 端口、全局 DP 大小、DP rank、DP "
"master 地址、DP RPC 端口和 TP 大小。P 仅读取位置 1–3 和 7；位置 4–6 未使用，保留用于调用兼容性。D "
"使用全部七个位置；其参数 5 是 D 主机的服务 IP。使用 DP1/TP8 以匹配固定的 KV 拓扑；更改拓扑还需要更新 connector JSON"
" 和设备分配。将[第 5.6.3 节](#563-proxy)中 A2 代理的 `--prefiller-ports` 和 `--decoder-"
"ports` 设置为作为参数 2 传递给相应脚本的 HTTP 端口。"

msgid ""
"| `MooncakeConnectorV1` | Proxy calls P, then D; D pulls KV | "
"`load_balance_proxy_server_example.py` | A3 and A2 PD recipes in [Section "
"5.4](#54-prefill-decode-disaggregation-a3) and [Section 5.6](#56-prefill-"
"decode-disaggregation-a2) |"
msgstr ""
"| `MooncakeConnectorV1` | 代理先调用 P，再调用 D；D 拉取 KV | "
"`load_balance_proxy_server_example.py` | [第 5.4 节](#54-prefill-decode-"
"disaggregation-a3)和[第 5.6 节](#56-prefill-decode-disaggregation-a2)中的 A3 和 A2"
" PD 配置 |"

msgid ""
"| `MooncakeConnectorV2` | Proxy calls P, then D; D pulls KV | "
"`load_balance_proxy_server_example.py` | 950DT W4A8C8 unequal-TP recipe in "
"[Section 5.5](#55-prefill-decode-disaggregation-950dt-products) |"
msgstr ""
"| `MooncakeConnectorV2` | 代理先调用 P，再调用 D；D 拉取 KV | "
"`load_balance_proxy_server_example.py` | [第 5.5 节](#55-prefill-decode-"
"disaggregation-950dt-products)中的 Ascend 950DT系列产品 W4A8C8 非等 TP 配置 |"

msgid ""
"Do not use a DP RPC port or Mooncake KV-transfer port as a proxy backend. If"
" requests reach the proxy but return no output, verify the P and D `/health`"
" endpoints from the proxy host, confirm that the configured backend "
"addresses exactly match each service's `--host` and HTTP port, and then run "
"the end-to-end checks in [Section 6](#6-functional-verification)."
msgstr ""
"不要将 DP RPC 端口或 Mooncake KV 传输端口用作代理后端。如果请求到达代理但没有返回输出，请从代理主机验证 P 和 D 的 "
"`/health` 端点，确认配置的后端地址与各服务的 `--host` 和 HTTP 端口完全匹配，然后运行[第 6 "
"节](#6-functional-verification)中的端到端检查。"

msgid ""
"Set `max_out_len` so that the input length plus output budget does not "
"exceed the service's `--max-model-len`. The A3 PD example in [Section "
"5.4](#54-prefill-decode-disaggregation-a3) is configured with `--max-model-"
"len 133120`; keep the prompt length and output budget within that limit."
msgstr ""
"设置 `max_out_len`，使输入长度加上输出预算不超过服务的 `--max-model-len`。[第 5.4 节](#54-prefill-"
"decode-disaggregation-a3)中的 A3 PD 示例配置为 `--max-model-len "
"133120`；请将提示长度和输出预算保持在该限制之内。"

msgid ""
"Refer to [vllm benchmark](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/benchmarking/) for "
"more details."
msgstr ""
"更多详细信息请参考 [vllm benchmark](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/benchmarking/)。"

msgid ""
"The table summarizes the deployment examples in [Section 5](#5-online-"
"service-deployment). Follow the linked scripts for the complete "
"configuration, and tune the values for your workload. NPUs are allocated to "
"the listed role on each host; the A3 PD roles share one host with 8 NPUs "
"each. DP is shown as global/local. `Max Num Seqs` and `Max Num Batched "
"Tokens` apply to each DP group."
msgstr ""
"下表汇总了[第 5 节](#5-online-service-"
"deployment)中的部署示例。请按照链接的脚本获取完整配置，并根据您的工作负载调整这些值。NPU 按列出的角色分配到各主机；A3 PD "
"角色共享一台主机，各使用 8 个 NPU。DP 以全局/本地形式显示。`Max Num Seqs` 和 `Max Num Batched Tokens`"
" 适用于每个 DP 组。"

msgid ""
"1. Choose a [Section 5](#5-online-service-deployment) deployment example and fix the input/output lengths and test concurrency before comparing performance.\n"
"2. Set `--max-model-len` for the workload, then balance `--max-num-seqs` and `--gpu-memory-utilization` against KV cache capacity and runtime memory usage.\n"
"3. Tune `--max-num-batched-tokens` separately for Prefill and Decode. Compare throughput, TTFT, and TPOT using the methods in [Section 8](#8-performance-evaluation).\n"
"4. Compare MTP, ACLGraph, and the optimizations below one at a time, checking output correctness as well as performance."
msgstr ""
"1. 选择一个[第 5 节](#5-online-service-deployment)部署示例，在比较性能之前固定输入/输出长度和测试并发数。\n"
"2. 为工作负载设置 `--max-model-len`，然后根据 KV 缓存容量和运行时内存使用情况平衡 `--max-num-seqs` 和 `--gpu-memory-utilization`。\n"
"3. 分别为 Prefill 和 Decode 调优 `--max-num-batched-tokens`。使用[第 8 节](#8-performance-evaluation)中的方法比较吞吐量、TTFT 和 TPOT。\n"
"4. 逐一比较 MTP、ACLGraph 以及下面的优化项，同时检查输出正确性和性能。"

msgid ""
"| MTP | `--speculative-config` with `method=qwen3_5_mtp` | Use the token "
"count in [Section 9.1](#91-recommended-configurations), tuning Prefill and "
"Decode together for PD deployment. |"
msgstr ""
"| MTP | 使用 `method=qwen3_5_mtp` 的 `--speculative-config` | 使用[第 9.1 "
"节](#91-recommended-configurations)中的 token 数量，对于 PD 部署需同时调优 Prefill 和 "
"Decode。 |"

msgid ""
"| Shared expert data parallelism | `enable_shared_expert_dp=true` | Enabled "
"on both P and D in [Section 5.4](#54-prefill-decode-disaggregation-a3) and "
"[Section 5.5](#55-prefill-decode-disaggregation-950dt-products), and on "
"Prefill in [Section 5.6](#56-prefill-decode-disaggregation-a2). Requires EP "
"and TP greater than 1; increases weight memory usage. |"
msgstr ""
"| 共享专家数据并行 | `enable_shared_expert_dp=true` | 在[第 5.4 节](#54-prefill-decode-"
"disaggregation-a3)和[第 5.5 节](#55-prefill-decode-disaggregation-950dt-"
"products)中在 P 和 D 上均启用，在[第 5.6 节](#56-prefill-decode-disaggregation-a2)中在 "
"Prefill 上启用。要求 EP 和 TP 大于 1；会增加权重内存使用量。 |"
